{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28458","headline":"泊秦淮 · 杜牧","name":"泊秦淮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟笼寒水月笼沙，夜泊秦淮近酒家。\n商女不知亡国恨，隔江犹唱後庭花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷五二三、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》杜牧条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}